# AGENTS.md

## Cargo-AI Agent Authoring (Codex)

This project is scaffolded for Cargo-AI agent development. Keep edits deterministic and validate with canonical Cargo-AI commands.

## Canonical Workflow
1. Start from a known-good example:
   - `.cargo-ai/examples/agent-minimal.json`
   - `.cargo-ai/examples/agent-enum-bounds-valid.json`
2. Copy to your working config (for example `my_agent.json`) and edit.
3. Validate only:
   - `cargo ai hatch <agent-name> --config <config.json> --check`
4. Fix reported schema/action errors and re-run step 3.
5. Build/export once validation passes:
   - `cargo ai hatch <agent-name> --config <config.json>`
6. Overwrite an existing export only when intentional:
   - `cargo ai hatch <agent-name> --config <config.json> --force`

